22.2 Changes to fees
We may change fees subject to Applicable Law and any required advance notice.
22.3 Taxes
You are responsible for determining and satisfying taxes arising from your use of the Services unless law requires us to calculate, withhold, collect or remit them.
We may request tax documentation and report information to tax authorities as required by law.

We may apply limits based on:
