Access to a marketing communication does not mean the promoted product is legally available to you.

Where consumer - protection or conduct rules apply, we will seek to provide outcomes consistent with those requirements, including:
- fair treatment;
- transparent material information;
- products designed for an appropriate target market;
- reasonable customer support;
- avoidance or mitigation of foreseeable harm;
- fair value where legally required;
- accessible complaints handling; and
- support for vulnerable customers where required.
Nothing in these Terms excludes a non - waivable consumer right.

We may review, restrict, suspend or limit an Account where reasonably necessary because of:
- legal or regulatory requirements;
- sanctions;
- financial - crime concerns;
- fraud or scam indicators;
- identity concerns;
- security incidents;
- chargeback or credit risk;
- breach of these Terms;
- suspected misuse;
- market - integrity concerns;
- insolvency;
